# Build context for the Dockerfile at the repository root. The verifier
# submodules the card uses (alpha-beta-CROWN, nnenum, pyrat) must stay in the
# context; the ones it does not use are dropped. mini_sweep_bench/ stays: it
# is the committed 50-instance benchmark.
.git
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
.venv/
.DS_Store
aiq/.conda_root
aiq/.shim/
src/VeriStressGT/verifiers/neuralsat
src/VeriStressGT/verifiers/nnv
src/VeriStressGT/verifiers/Marabou
*_run/
evaluation_runs/
runs/
